</div><div class='sfContentBlock'><div class="first-fold-wrap">
    <section class="section-content read-more-cont" id="health-ins">
        <div class="il-container">
            <div class="img-cont-sec"> 
                <div class="cont-sec">
                    <h1 class="heading1 mb-20">Health Insurance </h1>

                    <p class="text">Health insurance is like your best friend. It’s the calm voice that reminds you of your health coverage when your late-night symptom searches make you restless. And when things actually go wrong, it helps you cover your medical expenses so that you get the care you deserve. A health insurance policy, also commonly known as medical insurance, covers a wide range of medical expenses like in-patient treatment, pre-and post-hospitalisation, surgeries, etc. That’s not all. You can also personalise it to get coverage for outpatient (OPD) treatment, critical illnesses, pregnancy, etc.</p>



                    <div id="what-health" class="mt-40">
                        <h2 class="heading2 heading2-title">What is Health Insurance? </h2>

                        <p class="text">Health insurance or medical insurance protects you against rising medical costs. It is a legal contract wherein an insurer agrees to cover a range of medical expenses, including hospitalisations, daycare procedures and surgeries, for a certain amount (premium). And the best thing of this contract is the tenure– you get options ranging from one year to five years.</p>

                        <p class="text mt-10 more-cont">The best health insurance policies don’t just help you deal with rising healthcare costs, they provide coverage that goes beyond hospitalisation. For example, some policies also cover OPD treatments, preventive check-ups, ambulance charges, maternity expenses and more as per the policy's terms and conditions.</p>

                        <p class="text mt-10 more-cont">At ICICI Lombard, our health insurance policies start at just ₹11/day<sup>A</sup> and come with benefits so that you can focus on what truly matters: staying healthy. You can also opt for add-ons such as 2-hour hospitalisation, Jumpstart, OPD+ rider, etc to customise your coverage and help you feel prepared for any health emergency.</p>
                       <a href="javascript:;" class="r-more mt-20">Read more</a>   
                    </div>
                </div>
                <div class="img-sec">
                    <img data-src="/docs/default-source/assets/marketing/images/health-revamp/health-insurance-img.webp" alt="Health Insurance - Happy Family with Health Insurance" title="Health Insurance - Happy Family with Health Insurance" class="lazy health-ins-img">
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </section>

    <section class="section-content quick-sum-block" id="quick-sum">
        <div class="il-container quick-block">
            <div class="flex-block">
                <img src="/docs/default-source/assets/marketing/images/health-revamp/ai-ico.webp" alt="Quick summary" title="Quick summary">
                <h2 class="heading2 align-center">Quick Summary</h2>
            </div>
            <div class="arrow-list mt-40">
                <ul class="list list2">
                    <li class="list-item"><p class="text">Health insurance helps cover expenses related to hospitalisation, surgeries, critical illnesses, and pre- and post-hospitalisation care, helping you manage rising medical costs.</p></li>
                    <li class="list-item"><p class="text">You can customise your health insurance coverage with add-ons such as OPD+ Rider, Jumpstart, Worldwide Cover, and more, based on your healthcare needs. </p></li>
                    <li class="list-item"><p class="text">Selecting the right health insurance policy requires comparing coverage benefits, sum insured options, waiting periods, exclusions, and policy terms.</p></li>
                    <li class="list-item"><p class="text">Your health insurance premium is influenced by factors such as age, location, medical history, coverage chosen, add-ons selected, and applicable discounts. </p></li>
                    <li class="list-item"><p class="text">Cashless treatment at network hospitals enables convenient access to quality healthcare without the hassle of arranging funds during medical emergencies.</p></li>
                    <li class="list-item"><p class="text">Investing in health insurance early can help you secure broader coverage, complete waiting periods sooner, and stay financially prepared for future healthcare needs. </p></li>
                </ul>
            </div>
        </div>
    </section>

    <section class="section-content sahayak-explore-wrap" id="sahayak-explore">
      <div class="il-container">
        <div class="row">
          <div class="col-lg-12">
            <dv class="sahayak-explore-sec">
              <div class="sahayak-explore-block">

                <div class="sahayak-explore-img">
                  <img src="/docs/default-source/assets/health/explore-icici-heading.webp">
                </div>

                <div class="sahayak-explore-txt">
                  <h4>Get dedicated support with IL Sahayak, right inside the hospital.</h4>
                  <a href="javacript:void(0);" class="js_scrolltosahayak">Explore Now</a>
                </div>
              </div>
            </dv>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>


    <section class="section-content" id="health-work">
        <div class="il-container flex-wrap work-block">
            <h2 class="heading2 align-center">How Does Health Insurance Work?</h2>
            <p class="text sub-txt mt-30">Health insurance helps cover eligible medical expenses in exchange for a premium, offering financial support when you need healthcare treatment.</p>
            <p class="text mt-30"><strong>Here's an example of how it works:</strong></p>
            <div class="col-block flex-div mt-0">
                <div class="col-block-item width-30">
                    <div class="num"><span>1</span></div>
                    <div class="col-cont">
                        <p class="text">You want a health insurance policy with a high sum insured to secure yourself.  </p>
                    </div>
                </div>
                <div class="col-block-item width-30">
                    <div class="num"><span>2</span></div>
                    <div class="col-cont">
                        <p class="text">You purchase a health insurance plan with a <strong>₹1 crore sum insured</strong> and pay the applicable premium.</p>
                    </div>
                </div>
                <div class="col-block-item width-30">
                    <div class="num"><span>3</span></div>
                    <div class="col-cont">
                        <p class="text">At a later stage, you fall ill and require hospitalisation.</p>
                    </div>
                </div>
                <div class="col-block-item width-30">
                    <div class="num"><span>4</span></div>
                    <div class="col-cont">
                        <p class="text">You get admitted to a <a href="https://www.icicilombard.com/cashless-hospitals" class="link" target="_blank">network hospital</a> and opt for cashless treatment.  </p>
                    </div>
                </div>
                <div class="col-block-item width-30">
                    <div class="num"><span>5</span></div>
                    <div class="col-cont">
                        <p class="text">The total hospital bill comes to <strong>₹15 lakhs.</strong> </p>
                    </div>
                </div>
                <div class="col-block-item width-30">
                    <div class="num"><span>6</span></div>
                    <div class="col-cont">
                        <p class="text">Your insurer settles the admissible expenses directly with the hospital, and you only pay for expenses not covered under the policy. </p>
                    </div>
                </div>
                <div class="col-block-item width-30">
                    <div class="num"><span>7</span></div>
                    <div class="col-cont">
                        <p class="text">After the claim is settled, you still have <strong>₹85 lakhs</strong> of sum insured remaining, subject to the policy terms and conditions. </p>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </section>

 

    <section class="section-content bg-gray2 owl-div" id="health-policy">
        <div class="il-container">
            <h2 class="heading2 align-center">Types of Health Insurance Plans</h2>
            <p class="text sub-txt mt-30">Different health insurance plans are designed to meet different healthcare needs. Here are some common types:</p>

            <div class="col-wrap owl-carousel owl-theme owl-sec mt-30">
                <div class="col-item">
                    <img data-src="/docs/default-source/assets/marketing/images/health-revamp/individual-health-ins.webp" alt="Individual health insurance" title="Individual health insurance" class="lazy">
