                        <h3 class="heading3">Individual Health Insurance</h3>
                        <p class="text color-coolgray mt-10"><a href="https://www.icicilombard.com/health-insurance/individual-health-insurance" class="link" target="_blank">Individual health insurance</a> covers a single person and helps pay for hospitalisation, AYUSH treatments, and other medical expenses. It’s a great choice for young professionals and anyone looking to stay financially prepared for future health emergencies.  </p>
                        <a href="https://www.icicilombard.com/health-insurance/individual-health-insurance" class="primary-btn view-plan-btn mt-20" target="_blank">View Plan</a>
                    </div>
                </div>
                <div class="col-item">
