<section class="section-content" id="imp-health">
    <div class="il-container">
        <h2 class="heading2 align-center">Importance of Buying Health Insurance </h2>
        <div class="row-block mt-20 owl-block owl-carousel owl-theme">
            <div class="row-item">
                <div class="img-wrap"><img src="/docs/default-source/assets/marketing/images/health-revamp/medical-inflation.webp" alt="Health Insurance Importance - Medical Inflation" title="Health Insurance Importance - Medical Inflation" class="lazy"></div>
                <div class="row-cont">
                    <h3 class="heading3">Medical Inflation </h3>
                    <p class="text mt-10">Healthcare costs are increasing every year. Medical tests, hospital stays and treatments cost much more than they did earlier. Health insurance helps protect your savings from rising medical expenses. </p>
                </div>
            </div>
            <div class="row-item">
                <div class="img-wrap"><img src="/docs/default-source/assets/marketing/images/health-revamp/lifestyle-related-disease.webp" alt="Health Insurance Importance - Lifestyle-Related Diseases" title="Health Insurance Importance - Lifestyle-Related Diseases" class="lazy"></div>
                <div class="row-cont">
                    <h3 class="heading3">Lifestyle-Related Diseases</h3>
                    <p class="text mt-10">Busy schedules, stress, and food habits are leading to more cases of diabetes, blood pressure and heart problems. These conditions often need regular treatment and monitoring, which health insurance helps manage. </p>
                </div>
            </div>
            <div class="row-item">
                <div class="img-wrap"><img src="/docs/default-source/assets/marketing/images/health-revamp/environmental-factor.webp" alt="Health Insurance Importance - Environmental Factors" title="Health Insurance Importance - Environmental Factors" class="lazy"></div>
                <div class="row-cont">
                    <h3 class="heading3">Environmental Factors </h3>
                    <p class="text mt-10">Poor air quality and rising pollution levels are causing breathing issues, allergies, and heart-related complications. Medical insurance ensures you can seek medical care without delaying treatment due to cost concerns. </p>
                </div>
            </div>
            <div class="row-item">
                <div class="img-wrap"><img src="/docs/default-source/assets/marketing/images/health-revamp/critical-illness-ico.webp" alt="Health Insurance Importance - Critical Illnesses" title="Health Insurance Importance - Critical Illnesses" class="lazy"></div>
                <div class="row-cont">
                    <h3 class="heading3">Critical Illnesses </h3>
                    <p class="text mt-10">Conditions like cancer and heart disease are no longer rare or age-specific. Treatment often starts immediately and continues for months. Health insurance helps you focus on care, not expenses. </p>
                </div>
            </div>
            <div class="row-item">
                <div class="img-wrap"><img src="/docs/default-source/assets/marketing/images/health-revamp/medical-emergency.webp" alt="Health Insurance Importance- Medical Emergencies" title="Health Insurance Importance- Medical Emergencies" class="lazy"></div>
                <div class="row-cont">
                    <h3 class="heading3">Medical Emergencies </h3>
                    <p class="text mt-10">Accidents, sudden illnesses and unexpected hospital visits can happen anytime. Health insurance helps you stay financially prepared when life takes an unexpected turn. </p>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</section>

   <section class="section-content linear-red-bg" id="hosp-bill">
