        <div class="first-second-sec">
            <div class="first-sec">
                <h2 class="heading2">How to Buy Health<br> Insurance Online? </h2>
                <p class="text">Buying health insurance online is quite straightforward. Just follow the below steps: </p>
                <img src="/docs/default-source/assets/marketing/images/health-revamp/how-to-buy.webp" alt="How to Buy Health Insurance Online" title="How to Buy Health Insurance Online" class="img-hide">
            </div>
