<section class="section-content" id="doc-require-claim">
    <div class="il-container">
        <div class="cont-img-block flex-div">
            <div class="cont-block width-50">
                <h2 class="heading2">What are the Documents Required for Health Insurance Claims? </h2>
                <p class="text mt-10"> The documents you need to submit for a health insurance claim depend on whether you opted for cashless treatment or a reimbursement claim. You don’t need to submit anything besides a pre-authorisation form and your policy/insured member details for a cashless hospitalisation. However, you need to submit the following documents if you opted for a health insurance reimbursement claim: </p>
                <div class="list-block org-list mt-20">
                    <ul>
                        <li class="text">Duly filled claim form – You can download the claim form from <a href="/downloads" class="link" target="_blank">downloads</a> (Select ‘Health Insurance’ &gt; Select ‘Claims’ &gt; Download Claim Form)</li>
                        <li class="text">Government-issued ID proof of the insured member</li>
                        <li class="text">KYC form</li>
                        <li class="text">NEFT details or cancelled cheque copy</li>
                        <li class="text">Discharge summary (with details of complaint &amp; treatment availed)</li>
                        <li class="text">Final hospital bill (with detailed break-up), along with interim bills &amp; payment receipts</li>
                        <li class="text">All investigation reports and pharmacy bills supported by doctor's prescription</li>
                        <li class="text">Any other documents required by the insurer</li>
                    </ul>
                </div>
                <p class="text mt-30">Get detailed information about list of <a href="/health-insurance/health-claim/" class="link" target="_blank">claim documents required.</a> </p>
            </div>
             <div class="img-block">
                <img src="/docs/default-source/assets/marketing/images/health-revamp/document-health-claim.webp" alt="Health Insurance Claim - Documents Required" title="Health Insurance Claim - Documents Required" class="img-hide">
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</section>

<section class="section-content bg-warmgray" id="download-block">
    <div class="il-container">
        <h2 class="heading2 align-center">How to Download Health Insurance Policy Document Online?</h2>
        <p class="text align-center mt-20">You can quickly download your ICICI Lombard health insurance policy document online by following these steps: </p>
        <div class="download-sec">
            <div class="download-item">
                <div class="strong-no">1</div>
                <div class="down-cont">
                    <h4 class="heading4">Log in</h4>
                    <p class="text mt-10">Log into our website or IL TakeCare App using your registered mobile number and complete the OTP verification. </p>
                </div>
            </div>
            <div class="download-item">
                <div class="strong-no">2</div>
                <div class="down-cont">
                    <h4 class="heading4">Policy Dashboard</h4>
                    <p class="text mt-10">After you log in, you’ll be able to see all the policies linked to your number in the ‘My Policies’ or Policy Dashboard section. </p>
                </div>
            </div>
            <div class="download-item">
                <div class="strong-no">3</div>
                <div class="down-cont">
                    <h4 class="heading4">Download Policy Document</h4>
                    <p class="text mt-10">Select the relevant health insurance policy and tap on ‘Download Policy Document’ to get the PDF instantly. </p>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
        <p class="text align-center">You can check out the brochures and policy wordings of our health insurance policies in <a href="/downloads" class="link" target="_blank">downloads</a> (Select ‘Health Insurance’ &gt; Select ‘Brochure’ or ‘Policy Wordings’). </p>
    </div>
</section>

<section class="section-content" id="renew-health">
    <div class="il-container">
        <div class="cont-img-block flex-div">
            <div class="cont-block width-50">
                <h2 class="heading2">How to Renew Health Insurance Online?</h2>
                <p class="text mt-20">Renewing your ICICI Lombard health insurance policy is quite hassle-free. Just follow these steps to renew your health insurance online: </p>
              
                <div class="series-block series-style1 mt-30">
                    <div class="series-item">
                        <div class="series-no">1</div>
                        <p class="series-txt">Visit our website</p>
                    </div>
                    <div class="series-item">
                        <div class="series-no">2</div>
                        <p class="series-txt">Under the Renewals tab, click on <a href="/health-insurance/renew-online#/Health" class="link" target="_blank">‘Health Policy Renewal’</a></p>
                    </div>
                    <div class="series-item">
                        <div class="series-no">3</div>
                        <p class="series-txt">Choose how you want to proceed: Policy Number/Registered Mobile Number/Loan Account Number</p>
                    </div>
                    <div class="series-item">
                        <div class="series-no">4</div>
                        <p class="series-txt">Enter the required details and click on “Proceed”</p>
                    </div>
                    <div class="series-item">
                        <div class="series-no">5</div>
                        <p class="series-txt">Review your health insurance policy. You can also increase your sum insured and/or opt for add-ons.</p>
                    </div>
                    <div class="series-item">
                        <div class="series-no">6</div>
                        <p class="series-txt">Pay the applicable renewal premium to stay protected with ICICI Lombard. </p>
                    </div>
                </div>
                <p class="text mt-20">Note: Remember to renew your health insurance policy before the expiry date mentioned in your policy document.</p>
            </div>
            <div class="img-block">
                <img src="/docs/default-source/assets/marketing/images/health-revamp/how-to-renew.webp" alt="Steps To Renew Health Insurance Online" title="How To Renew Health Insurance Online" class="img-hide">
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</section>

<section class="section-content bg-sec-blue" id="portability-health">
    <div class="il-container">
        <div class="mid-width">
            <h2 class="heading2 align-center">What is Portability in Health Insurance?</h2>
            <p class="text mt-20">Portability gives you the option to switch your existing health insurance from one insurer to another whilst retaining your accrued benefits. These benefits can include your waiting period credits for pre-existing diseases, maternity and more. Health insurance portability gives you the option to opt for better sum insured, features and services from a trusted health insurance provider.</p>
            <p class="text mt-10">Porting to an ICICI Lombard health insurance policy is quite simple. You need to raise a portability request about 45-60 days prior to your current policy’s renewal date. We will review your portability and proposal forms, check your medical and claims history, and then decide whether to issue a health insurance policy based on our underwriting rules. </p>

            <a href="/health-insurance/health-policy-portability" class="primary-btn buy-now-btn port-exis-btn full-btn-width mt-30" target="_blank">Port Existing Policy</a>
        </div>
    </div>
</section>

